# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so without this a clone would receive
# CRLF and every recorded SHA-256 would fail to reproduce. Protocol and evidence
# hashes are load-bearing (PLAN_COMPOSITIONAL_DIFFERENTIAL_ORACLE.md section 14),
# so documents and evidence are pinned to LF in the working tree as well as in
# the object store.
*.md   text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
SHA256SUMS text eol=lf
